<title>FRANCE: Carrefour Sept sales up 0.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Carrefour Sept sales up 0.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>September, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					14,130    up 0.2 pct</p>
<p>    Of which France				8,240  down 4.4 pct</p>
<p>    Nine months to end-Sept		  124,615    up 5.7 pct</p>
<p>    Of which France			     73,857    up 2.5 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Carrefour released the figures in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
